{"id":30745,"vol":{"id":4207,"name":"The Sandman"},"num":"1","name":"Sleep of the Just","title":"The Sandman #1","year":"1989","date":"1989-01-31","store":"1988-11-29","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/9116/2199272-01.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/9116/2199272-01.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"A group of magic-invoking men seeking immortality use a spell to capture Death, but instead they get her younger brother, Dream. This leads to seventy years keeping him entrapped, the world suffers greatly from these years without sleep, or with un-waking sleep but finally after seventy years, Dream escapes, and he's looking for revenge!","people":[{"id":50470,"name":"Art Young","role":"editor"},{"id":24246,"name":"Dave McKean","role":"cover"},{"id":5584,"name":"Dick Giordano","role":"editor"},{"id":43437,"name":"Karen Berger","role":"editor"},{"id":7377,"name":"Mike Dringenberg","role":"inker"},{"id":40841,"name":"Neil Gaiman","role":"writer"},{"id":13475,"name":"Robbie Busch","role":"colorist"},{"id":5329,"name":"Sam Kieth","role":"artist, penciler"},{"id":6224,"name":"Todd Klein","role":"letterer"}],"chars":[{"id":9299,"name":"Wesley Dodds","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11161/111612243/8934065-4350391481-FvZGvkvWcAMpVll.jpg"},{"id":11171,"name":"Dream of the Endless (Morpheus)","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/6/68065/8389315-0b.jpg"},{"id":44293,"name":"Elvis Presley","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/6/62058/2536830-elvis_presley_by_denism79_d5bezv5.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":40643,"name":"\"The Sandman\" Preludes & Nocturnes"}]}